div><p class=\"text-gray-900 leading-relaxed font-medium text-sm md:text-base\">Built like a tank—a favorite in Gulf barbershops for its longevity.</p></div><div class=\"mb-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 via-amber-50 to-orange-50 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-amber-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-gray-900 pb-2 border-b border-amber-200/50\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-400 to-amber-500 p-1 rounded-md shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3 h-3 text-white fill-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm text-amber-700\">Highlights</h3></div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2.5 bg-white/70 rounded-md border border-white/50 shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.