ntext\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/best-beard-trimmers-uae#itemlist\",\"name\":\"7 Best Beard Trimmers in UAE (2026) – Prices & Reviews\",\"description\":\"Keeping a sharp beard in Dubai’s humidity isn’t easy. As we head into 2026, whether you want heavy stubble, a clean corporate look, or a fade that rivals a barbershop, you need a tool that can handle...\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/best-beard-trimmers-uae\",\"itemListOrder\":\"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderDescending\",\"numberOfItems\":7,\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/best-beard-trimmers-uae#webpage\"},\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Philips Multigroom Series 3000 (MG3720/33)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/philips-multigroom-series-3000-mg3720-trimmer\",\"description\":\"The \\\"Toyota Corolla\\\" of trimmers—reliable, affordable, and just works.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/e95b77a3f2d866048fbcf3ed97f1e3ef7d502ca7-1294x1088.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Philips\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":110,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4979m6R\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.8,\"reviewCount\":64043,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Kemei 2299 Professional Zero-Gapped Trimmer\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/kemei-2299-professional-trimmer\",\"description\":\"Professional barber-level cuts for the price of a burger.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/783e4ff7b9e9265760fac778f89bef5b719397a9-1500x1489.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Kemei\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":44,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4oXi3p0\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"reviewCount\":1640,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Philips Series 7000 All-in-One Trimmer (MG7920/15)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/philips-series-7000-mg7920-trimmer\",\"description\":\"The perfect upgrade from the 3000 series if you need waterproofing and body grooming.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/a4e3e265a0d6d2716d01b60e5585c11e410608ce-1424x1041.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Philips\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":163,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/3YtzpPq\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.2,\"reviewCount\":64043,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Philips OneBlade Pro (QP6542/10)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/philips-oneblade-pro-qp6542-trimmer\",\"description\":\"The only tool for men with sensitive skin who want \\\"Designer Stubble.\\\"\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/b310b3f7f6a3812f368b8bc5d70e4950d4c48189-1359x1500.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Philips\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":239,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/3XUevcc\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"reviewCount\":13966,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Braun Series 9 Beard Trimmer (9420)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/braun-series-9-beard-trimmer-bt9420\",\"description\":\"The Mercedes-Benz of trimmers—cuts through thick, wire-like beards effortlessly.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/8da35f92dd007056577b8764692ae5aeca5f930d-1488x1500.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Braun\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":407,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4iWPNkR\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.2,\"reviewCount\":379,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Panasonic ER2051 (Made in Japan)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/panasonic-er2051-trimmer\",\"description\":\"Built like a tank—a favorite in Gulf barbershops for its longevity.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/aa4226a4e66399aba58778632e126de12ac58e60-1500x1492.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Panasonic\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":178,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/48SJUAS\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"reviewCount\":1168,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"OLOV For Man (21-Piece Kit)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/olov-for-man-grooming-kit-trimmer\",\"description\":\"The best \\\"Giftable\\\" set—looks impressive with the stand and accessories.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/400bccc68e11c44f686fc62d8570f1b7dc3582d9-1500x1493.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"OLOV\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":169,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/3Mzntco\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.3,\"reviewCount\":5841,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}}]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which brand of beard trimmer is best in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"In the UAE market, Philips and Braun are the top-rated brands. Philips is preferred for budget and all-in-one styling (like the Multigroom series), while Braun is the top choice for premium, professional-grade engineering and durability.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which is the best men's beard trimmer for 2026?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For overall value, the Philips Multigroom 3000 (MG3720) is the best seller due to its durability and low price (under AED 100). For premium performance, the Braun Series 9 is the top choice for thick beards.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which trimmer does Virat Kohli use?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Virat Kohli is the brand ambassador for Philips. He is most famously associated with the Philips OneBlade and the Philips Multigroom Series, which he uses to maintain his signature sharp beard style.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of a good trimmer in Dubai?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Trimmer prices in Dubai vary by features. A reliable budget trimmer like the Philips MG3720 costs between AED 60 and AED 90. Premium waterproof models with fast charging range from AED 150 to AED 400.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I buy original trimmers in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The most reliable platforms for original warranties are Amazon.ae and Noon.com. You can also find them in physical electronics stores, such as Sharaf DG or Carrefour, although online prices are often 10-20% lower.\"}}]}]}20:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2a\"}}],\"$L2b\"]\n22:null\n26:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"7 Best Beard Trimmers in UAE (2026) – Prices & Reviews | TopTenUAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Keeping a sharp beard in Dubai’s humidity isn’t easy. As we head into 2026, whether you want heavy stubble, a clean corporate look, or a fade that rivals...\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"application-name\",\"content\":\"TopTenUAE\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"best in UAE,top 10 UAE,Dubai reviews,buying guide UAE,UAE rankings\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"TopTenUAE Editorial Team\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"TopTenUAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"category\",\"content\":\"top-ten\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"article:publisher\",\"content\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2025-12-25T10:21:00.000Z\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://